WEBVTT

00:10:28.706 --> 00:10:31.434
and the number one issue
has been women's rights.

00:10:31.950 --> 00:10:34.076
Women are starting new organizations,

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:36.815
they are volunteering on campaigns,

00:10:36.839 --> 00:10:38.859
and they're taking on every issue

00:10:38.883 --> 00:10:42.598
from gun-safety reform
to public education.

00:10:43.323 --> 00:10:46.370
And women are running for office
in record numbers,

00:10:46.394 --> 00:10:47.883
and they are winning.

00:10:47.907 --> 00:10:49.095
So -- (Laughs)

00:10:49.119 --> 00:10:50.450
(Applause)

00:10:50.474 --> 00:10:54.475
Women like Lucy McBath from Georgia.

00:10:54.499 --> 00:10:57.907
(Applause and cheers)

00:10:58.455 --> 00:11:02.740
Lucy lost her son to gun violence,